  "body": "## Description\nThis PR implements an autonomous Claude Code sub-agent for PR code reviews, fulfilling all acceptance criteria for Bounty #4 ($150).\n\n## Deliverables\n- `claude_review.py`: CLI tool supporting direct PR inspection (`--pr <url>`).\n- Structured Markdown review output (Summary, Risks, Suggestions, Confidence Score).\n- GitHub Action CI integration documented in `AGENT_README.md`.\n- Comprehensive test suite in `test_agent.py` validated against real GitHub PRs.\n\nCloses #4\n",
